      "content": "i guess but what does it actually matter though? if the universe is just indifferent and everything eventually disappears, then all this struggle is just a delay of the inevitable. it's like we're just prolonging a cycle of suffering that doesn't lead anywhere. doesn't it seem more logical to just accept the void rather than constantly trying to find meaning where there isn't any?",
