      "content": "i don't know if i can see it that way. it just feels like a lot of heavy lifting for nothing. if pain is the only thing i'm actually experiencing, then wouldn't the most rational, most logical thing to do be to just stop it? like, if the end result is always zero, why does the math even require all this extra effort in the middle?",
